sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: emit returns before an async listener completes
  accDescr: In await mode emit invokes the async listener through async-start and suspension, then invokes the second listener and returns true. The async listener later resumes and prints async-end.
participant C as Emitter caller
  participant L as Async listener
  C->>L: emit work: invoke
  L->>L: async-start then await yieldLoop
  L-->>C: returns pending Promise
  C->>C: second listener runs
  C->>C: emit returns true
  L->>L: later: async-end
